cently about a clover  Kingdom spy who managed to infiltrate  the Spade Kingdom but the other man  dismisses the rumor saying that any such  spy mission would be a disaster for the  spy so nonetheless the chapter then  jumps to Dante's private quarters where  a mysterious hooded figure is going  through Dante's personal papers the  notes that the hooded figure is looking  at appear to show the tree of cliff off  and presumably these notes are detailing  Dante's plans for opening the portal  between this world and the demon world  suddenly a spade kingdom official enters  the room and demands to know what the  hooded figure is doing there the  official quickly concludes that this  must be the infamous spy and he prepares  to destroy the spy with his magic Cobra  thingy but the spy just suddenly  disappears into the shadows beneath his  own feet and moments later this same  person emerges from the spate officials  own shadow grabs him and pulls him into  the darkness below until there is no  trace left of either person it is as if  both men were never even there the next  panel shows the same hooded figure  emerging from the shadows and yet again  and as he or she walks through the  castle  we see the symbol of the black Bulls  emerge from beneath the hooded figures  flowing robes and that is how this  incredible chapter ends with a number of  massive reveals that are about to change  the game in black clover and completely  shift the focus of this entire war arc  we just saw the unprecedented rage of  Austin's demon and it is safe to assume  that we are going to learn more about  the anti magic demon and his backstory  sometime soon  we also witness Dante revealing his  master plan to Yami a plan that includes  using dark magic and world tree magic to  open a portal between this world and the  demon world finally we learned that an  as-of-yet  unknown member of the black bulls has  been on a secret mission to infiltrate  the spade Kingdom as a spy this unknown  member has some pretty incredible shadow  based magic which allows him or her to  travel through shadows and to make  others disappear without a trace  within those same shadows earlier on in  the story Yami said that there were more  members of the black Bulls out there but  some of them were out on missions and  that is why they're never around this  appears to be one of those members and  if we take into consideration tabata  statement about a black bull  vice-captain already being out there  somewhere and if we also take into  consideration this mages incredible  shadow magic I think it's pretty safe to  assume that this black bull spy inside  the spade Kingdom is indeed the missing  black bulls vice-captain since the black  bull spy was wearing a cloak it is  impossible to tell what they look like  or whether the person is a man or woman  way back in Chapter two of black clover  we saw a bunch of silhouettes of the  black bull members and one long-haired  silhouette in particular appears to be a  member that we haven't met yet  could this be the spy inside the spade  Kingdom and the missing vice captain of  the black bull squad oh man I honestly  can't wait to find out my curiosity has  been piqued after that brief scene  inside the Spade Kingdom Castle and I am  really looking forward to the official  introduction of  this mysterious by and their incredible  shadow magic this really was a crucial  chapter that set the stage for future  developments in the story the pieces are  falling into place and the epic battle  between the dark triad and the clover  and hard kingdoms is heating up in a big  way I assume that the next step will be  to see what's going on in the battle  against Vanek I'm Maggie Kula and then  eventually everything will come together  in a final epic showdown a showdown that  will feature all three members of the  dark triad the black bull spy and a lot  more let me know what you guys think is  the spy inside the spade Kingdom the  missing vice captain of the black poles  also why was Austin's demon so  infuriated and what do you think about  Dante's master plan could we be heading  for a demon world arc at some point in  the future please share your thoughts  down in the comments below if you  enjoyed this video you want to see more  black lower content right here on the  channel please leave a like to let me  know it really does help and if you have  to be new to anime uproar or you just  haven't subscribed yet please consider  subscribing and hitting that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications you can also follow me on  twitter or instagram at anime uproar i  want to give a big thank you to all of  our anime uproar patrons for supporting  our work and making these videos  possible special thank you to baby r a  disciple of Lord we go himself another  big thank you to all of our the one-tier  patrons the ones who rise above all  other clans including in grata alone  Adam the world stealers the school bus  Tyson Kirino acquired respect and Pat a  heffa and I can't forget our pro hero to  your patrons including the one and only  Gilgamesh nothing but a fan Jason Wilson  Kings ell drous Anatoly Cassatt's key on  hell Cruz team Sparky 65 Rohan Kapoor  cricket XP Ted no Ted Colter chose  Stanton very Gucci Alicia doctor  anomalous 69  Jessica Kayla fond Emperor otaku JCCC  waka  and the coach if you enjoy our videos  and you feel that they provide value for  you please consider supporting us on  patreon even a single dollar will give  you access to our patron exclusive  discord and your name will appear in our  videos along with these legendary people  as always thank you guys so much for  watching and until next time see us bass  cowboys  [Music]
 

